      "id": "claim_0f1fbcb8816d4e15bb908ef79a13055d",
      "statement": "voice_agent.py imports the graph directly from agent.py and compiles it with an in-memory MemorySaver; it runs the same five-source fan-out (RemoteOK, Himalayas, Remotive, Jobicy, Workable via fetch_wjobs) used by REST and MCP, not a separate agent.",
