    {
      "id": "claim_9338b409d638477b9ddd308206a290f3",
      "statement": "LangGraphProcessor.process_frame routes by checking DETAIL_PREFIXES first (tell me more, more about, details, what about) via _describe, then dispatches on the first word: reset clears memory, FEEDBACK_WORDS (no/skip/without/not/exclude) call resume, and anything else calls run; all blocking calls run via asyncio.to_thread and a _last_processed_message guard deduplicates repeated frames.",
